: 来源: https://docs.anthropic.com/en/api/messages-streaming（Messages API SSE 事件流）与 https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/tool-use，2026-09-10 按官方文档手写（离线回放，无真实 key）
: 事件序：message_start → content_block_start/delta/stop（每块带 index）→ message_delta（usage 为累计值）→ message_stop；ping/未知事件跳过；input_json_delta.partial_json 分片拼成完整参数
: 覆盖类②工具调用：两个 tool_use 块（index 0/1）；块 0 的 input_json_delta 分两片（拼接后 = 完整 JSON）；usage 累计值只在 message_delta 出现一次
event: message_start
data: {"type":"message_start","message":{"id":"msg_m2c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","content":[],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"output_tokens":1}}}

event: content_block_start
data: {"type":"content_block_start","index":0,"content_block":{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_m2c_a","name":"read_file","input":{}}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"input_json_delta","partial_json":"{\"pa"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"input_json_delta","partial_json":"th\":\"a.ts\"}"}}

event: content_block_stop
data: {"type":"content_block_stop","index":0}

event: content_block_start
data: {"type":"content_block_start","index":1,"content_block":{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_m2c_b","name":"read_file","input":{}}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"input_json_delta","partial_json":"{\"path\":\"b.ts\"}"}}

event: content_block_stop
data: {"type":"content_block_stop","index":1}

event: message_delta
data: {"type":"message_delta","delta":{"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null},"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"output_tokens":7}}

event: message_stop
data: {"type":"message_stop"}
